WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.210
Camille.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.380
If you're watching this,that
means I'm dead.

00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:09.592
The reading of the will is tomorrow morning.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.470
Last time I spoke to him was 11 years ago.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.306
I don't think you realize what's ahead of you.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:21.771
Your father's legacy is the biggest 
wine collection in the world.

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:26.192
Its full value, 148 million dollars.

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:31.406
He set up a test 
to determine who would inherit this.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:36.661
His daughter or his exceptional student.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.414
The palate is a muscle.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:43.710
Liquorice?

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:44.919
Yes, this is.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.255
She scares you.
Are you afraid of her?

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:49.883
She seems to have access to 
things I don't understand.

00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:52.552
They're not just tests.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:54.679
It's a message.

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:57.974
There's clearly something
 between us.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.352
Legacy is a tragedy.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:06.441
Ms. Leger?

